rName":"Kaedehara Kazuha","textMapHash":1559794602,"text":"The wind here carries a touch of sea-salt and the distant woody scent of merchant ships... and it brings news of old friends, too.","nextNodeIds":[745230402]},{"nodeId":745230402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30911,"speakerName":"Kaedehara Kazuha","textMapHash":186372394,"text":"#Have you been well, {NICKNAME}?","nextNodeIds":[745230403,745230404]},{"nodeId":745230403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":599526538,"text":"It's been a while, Kazuha.","nextNodeIds":[745230405]},{"nodeId":745230405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30911,"speakerName":"Kaedehara Kazuha","textMapHash":3294541802,"text":"The Crux is presently docked in Inazuma for resupply. I decided to take the rare opportunity to visit my homeland, to take in its sights and sounds, and listen to the wind that blows here.","nextNodeIds":[745230406]},{"nodeId":745230406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30911,"speakerName":"Kaedehara Kazuha","textMapHash":2985253962,"text":"The winds of Ritou are always more clamorous than elsewhere, mixed with partings and reunions, hope and confusion... It is a place where you can hear a great many stories.","nextNodeIds":[745230407,745230408]},{"nodeId":745230407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":342112058,"text":"Would you mind if I took a picture of you?","nextNodeIds":[745230409]},{"nodeId":745230409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30911,"speakerName":"Kaedehara Kazuha","textMapHash":1167606498,"text":"Hehe. All things in this world have their shape, and so it is with the wind, albeit glimpsed in the falling leaves, the rising waves, or in the moment when a traveler's clothes flutter.","nextNodeIds":[745230410]},{"nodeId":745230410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30911,"speakerName":"Kaedehara Kazuha","textMapHash":2079867962,"text":"I hope that my presence will allow you to give shape to this ephemeral force.","nextNodeIds":[745230411,745230412]},{"nodeId":745230411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1331037114,"text":"Here we go, then.","nextNodeIds":[745230413]},{"nodeId":745230413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30911,"speakerName":"Kaedehara Kazuha","textMapHash":2483604786,"text":"In that case, may you write the verse that best describes this moment.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":745230412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1633043394,"text":"Just stay as you were earlier and feel the wind.","nextNodeIds":[745230413]},{"nodeId":745230408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1482711018,"text":"I'd like to capture the wind that blows at this moment as well.","nextNodeIds":[745230409]},{"nodeId":745230404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":479640002,"text":"What brings you here?","nextNodeIds":[745230405]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"7452301"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7452302,"order":2,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":1601891044,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7452301,4],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":